# Secret used to authenticate the Vercel Cron snapshot job (/api/cron/snapshot).
# Set the same value in the Vercel project env vars; Vercel sends it as
# "Authorization: Bearer <CRON_SECRET>" when invoking the cron. Optional in dev.
